{
    "$comment": "Shared runtime manifest consumed by build-time FetchContent gates and the launcher-side runtime installer. Each entry describes a downloadable payload that carries the minimal binaries required to bring a plugin runtime online without a pre-installed SDK. Empty sha256 fields indicate that integrity checking is deferred to the primary URL host; set a value to make the download reproducible.",
